/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed: the workspace pins wasmtime to one major on purpose (R-D17), so the
# monthly bump is a reviewable `lock-diff` PR, and the shell binary (R-D8) deploys this graph.
# The guest fixtures are separate wasm32-only workspaces built in CI; their locks are build
# artifacts (a fresh resolve is fine for a test fixture), so they are not committed.
/fixtures/*/Cargo.lock
